2026-11-16 13:32:06 | RESPONSE | sactor.llm:160 | The compile error came from `#[derive(Default)]`. The standard library only implements `Default` for arrays of length 32 or less, so `[u8; 64]` doesn't have it. I removed the derive and wrote `Default` by hand, with `buffer` set to `[0u8; 64]`.

